<%- include('./include/_header') %>
<main class="container page narrow">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR PROFILE</p><h1>프로필 정보 확인</h1></div></div>
  <p class="notice">소셜 계정에서 확인되지 않은 정보만 입력해 주세요. 제공된 정보는 자동으로 채워져 있습니다.</p>
  <form class="panel form-stack" action="/profile" method="post">
    <label>성명<input name="name" maxlength="80" autocomplete="name" value="<%= user.name || '' %>" required></label>
    <label>이메일<input name="email" type="email" maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" value="<%= user.email || '' %>" required></label>
    <label>전화번호<input name="phone" type="tel" maxlength="20" pattern="[0-9+() -]{8,20}" autocomplete="tel" value="<%= user.phone || '' %>" required></label>
    <button class="button primary" type="submit">프로필 저장</button>
  </form>
</main>
<%- include('./include/_footer') %>
